## 2. Business Background

NovaPay Financial Services is a financial technology organisation headquartered in Lagos, Nigeria.

Its services include:

- Mobile money transfers
- Merchant payment processing
- Bill payments
- Micro-lending
- Third-party financial service integrations

The case study describes an organisation supporting more than three million users and over 500 merchants.

As NovaPay expands across multiple jurisdictions, its information security and compliance requirements become increasingly complex.

The organisation requires consistent governance arrangements to protect customer information, maintain reliable payment services, manage suppliers, and demonstrate accountability to banking partners and regulators.

