## 16. Project Limitations

This project was developed from an academic business scenario and supporting documentation.

The following limitations apply:

- No direct access to NovaPay's production systems was provided.
- No live technical security assessment was performed.
- Risk scores are provisional and require operational validation.
- Proposed policies are not evidence of implemented controls.
- No ISO/IEC 27001 certification is claimed.
- Regulatory applicability requires further jurisdiction-specific verification.
- The Statement of Applicability contains 20 selected controls rather than a complete assessment of all 93 Annex A controls.
- Target residual risk scores have not been independently verified.

These limitations are explicitly acknowledged to preserve the accuracy and integrity of the assessment.

